        <li><span class="check-icon">&#10003;</span> <span><strong>Hybrid projects</strong> — mix uploaded footage with AI-generated content in the same storyboard.</span></li>
        <li><span class="check-icon">&#10003;</span> <span><strong>Reimagine uploads</strong> — use AI to transform your uploaded assets into new creative directions.</span></li>
        <li><span class="check-icon">&#10003;</span> <span><strong>Take-level trim controls</strong> — trim each clip to the perfect moment before assembling your sequence.</span></li>
      </ul>
